    "meaningful": true,
    "patch": "diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex c0b1033..ce49944 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -1,8 +1,27 @@\n-# Sample notes\n+# Notes library\n \n-Small helpers used by the replay fixtures.\n+This tree is the sample repository for replay.\n \n-- `increment` and `decrement` change a count.\n-- `formatCount` renders a count.\n-- `splitNotes` splits text into lines.\n-- `parseFlag` reads true and false.\n+## Counter\n+\n+increment adds one.\n+decrement subtracts one.\n+\n+## Format\n+\n+formatCount renders the number as text.\n+\n+## Notes\n+\n+splitNotes breaks on newlines.\n+\n+## Flags\n+\n+parseFlag accepts true and false.\n+\n+## Limits\n+\n+Callers keep the change small.\n+A wide edit fails the diff budget.\n+A long rewrite fails the line budget.\n+The gate still checks plan, tests, and contracts.\n"
